<title>FINLAND: FINNISH FEB NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 5.1 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH FEB NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 5.1 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations in Finland of</p>
<p>new private cars rose 5.1 percent year-on-year in February to</p>
<p>7,936 cars, the Information Centre of the Automobile Branch</p>
<p>said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p>				     change			  change</p>
<p>		    Feb '97     yr/yr pct   Jan-Feb '97   yr/yr pct</p>
<p> Private cars    7,936	  +5.1	   21,396	 +1.9</p>
<p> Vans		  746	 +22.9	    1,969	+27.0</p>
<p> Lorries	     316	 +13.7		667	 +6.0</p>
<p> Buses		  40	 +90.5		 94	 -6.0</p>
<p> Total	     9,03	   +6.9	   24,126	 +3.6</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
